    {
      "text": "A half-eaten sandwich caught the diamond thieves.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "hook",
        "show": "sandwich",
        "size": 560
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In February 2003 they opened a vault two floors under Antwerp.",
      "say": "In February two thousand three they opened a vault two floors under Antwerp.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "stranger",
        "count": 3,
        "hat": "cap",
        "label": "Antwerp, February 2003"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Its ten layers of security included a seismic alarm and heat sensors.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "10 layers",
        "sub": "Of security"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Over one weekend they opened more than 100 safe-deposit boxes.",
      "say": "Over one weekend they opened more than a hundred safe-deposit boxes.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "cast",
        "setting": "vault",
        "name": "The gang",
        "role": "Antwerp, 2003",
        "cast": [
          {
            "outfit": "coat",
            "outfitColor": "#1e2128",
            "hat": "cap",
            "hair": "none",
            "skin": "#e0b28c",
            "prop": "lantern",
            "expression": "focused",
            "look": 1
          },
          {
            "outfit": "coat",
            "outfitColor": "#2a2520",
            "hat": "cap",
            "hair": "none",
            "skin": "#d8a882",
            "prop": "gem",
            "expression": "sly",
            "look": -1
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Police put the haul at about $100 million.",
      "say": "Police put the haul at about a hundred million dollars.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "reveal",
        "item": "gem",
        "shape": "round",
        "openAt": 0.1,
        "stamp": "$100M",
        "stampAt": 0.9,
        "label": "Police estimate"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The next day a landowner found their trash dumped in his woods.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "cast",
        "setting": "plain",
        "name": "A landowner",
        "role": "Near Brussels",
        "gasp": 0.5,
        "cast": [
          {
            "outfit": "coat",
            "outfitColor": "#3b4a3a",
            "hat": "cap",
            "hair": "short",
            "hairColor": "#8a8580",
            "old": true,
            "skin": "#e6bb96",
            "expression": "surprised"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In it was a half-eaten sandwich with Leonardo Notarbartolo's DNA.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "DNA",
        "sub": "On the sandwich"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A court found Notarbartolo guilty of leading the gang,",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "cast",
        "setting": "plain",
        "name": "Leonardo Notarbartolo",
        "role": "Found guilty",
        "cast": [
          {
            "outfit": "suit",
            "outfitColor": "#22252d",
            "hair": "side",
            "hairColor": "#4a4440",
            "facial": "mustache",
            "old": true,
            "skin": "#e2b08a",
            "expression": "focused"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "and he got ten years, while three others got five.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "10 years",
        "sub": "The sentence"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Almost all of the diamonds have never been found.",
